%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontSize": "20px"}, "flowchart": {"useMaxWidth": false, "nodeSpacing": 55, "rankSpacing": 55}}}%%
flowchart TB
    Store[Publisher stores versioned template]
    Event[Publish TemplatePublished event]
    Consume[Template Update Service consumes event]
    Catalog[Read current template catalog]
    Version{Published version status}

    Store --> Event
    Event --> Consume
    Consume --> Catalog
    Catalog --> Version

    Version -->|First known version| First[Create template catalog entry]
    First --> Accepted[Mark publication processed]

    Version -->|Newer version| Load[Load previous and new templates]
    Load --> Compare[Calculate structured JSON diff]
    Compare --> Summary[Generate and cache readable summary]
    Summary --> Advance[Advance catalog latest version]
    Advance --> Accepted

    Version -->|Duplicate or older| Ignore[Ignore idempotently]
    Ignore --> Existing[Keep existing catalog state]

    Load -.->|Template unavailable| Retry[Retry event processing]
    Compare -.->|Comparison fails| Retry
